doc:sch-1-sec-577a-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "577A(2) Acceptance of undertaking about structural separation" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) For the purposes of paragraph (1)(b), a matter relating to transparency and equivalence in relation to the supply by Telstra of regulated services to:  (a) Telstra’s wholesale customers; and  (b) Telstra’s retail business units; during the period:  (c) beginning when the undertaking comes into force; and  (d) ending at the start of the designated day; is taken to be a matter that is in connection with paragraph (1)(a)." ;
    cof:pageNumber "15"^^xsd:integer .

concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-safeguards-act-2010-sch-1-sec-577a-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "577A(3) Acceptance of undertaking about structural separation"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-577a-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) The ACCC must not accept an undertaking under this section unless the ACCC is satisfied that:  (a) the undertaking provides for transparency and equivalence in relation to the supply by Telstra of regulated services to:  (i) Telstra’s wholesale customers; and ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00891  Schedule 1  Amendments" ;
    skos:definition "(3) The ACCC must not accept an undertaking under this section unless the ACCC is satisfied that:  (a) the undertaking provides for transparency and equivalence in relation to the supply by Telstra of regulated services to:  (i) Telstra’s wholesale customers; and ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00891  Schedule 1  Amendments"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "221e9c58afaa1a067c47e38844a9addd4ab0e7309f165313a02e4426af44951a" ;
    values:partOf concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-safeguards-act-2010-sch-1-sec-577a ;
    cof:pageNumber "15"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "The ACCC must not accept an undertaking under this section unless satisfied that the undertaking provides for transparency and equivalence." ;
    dc:description "transparency and equivalence" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
