concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-safeguards-act-2010-sch-1-sec-14-2-ss-24 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "14(24) Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-14-2-ss-24 ;
    values:originalText "(24) In this section: associated provision means:  (a) subsection 577BA(11); or  (b) subsection 577BC(2). fixed-line carriage service means:  (a) a carriage service that is supplied using a line to premises occupied or used by an end-user; or  (b) a service that facilitates the supply of a carriage service covered by paragraph (a). telecommunications market has the same meaning as in Part XIB of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010." ;
    skos:definition "(24) In this section: associated provision means:  (a) subsection 577BA(11); or  (b) subsection 577BC(2). fixed-line carriage service means:  (a) a carriage service that is supplied using a line to premises occupied or used by an end-user; or  (b) a service that facilitates the supply of a carriage service covered by paragraph (a). telecommunications market has the same meaning as in Part XIB of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "640f651055b03b2b5e39551644c4a48f6b135c8009ae73dd63629bb5e4761f82" ;
    values:partOf concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-safeguards-act-2010-sch-1-sec-14-2 ;
    cof:pageNumber "18"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Defines associated provision and fixed-line carriage service." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-safeguards-act-2010.pdf> ;
