    values:originalText "(24) In this section: associated provision means:  (a) subsection 577BA(11); or  (b) subsection 577BC(2). fixed-line carriage service means:  (a) a carriage service that is supplied using a line to premises occupied or used by an end-user; or  (b) a service that facilitates the supply of a carriage service covered by paragraph (a). telecommunications market has the same meaning as in Part XIB of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010." ;
