    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(5A) Before making or varying an instrument under subsection (5), the Minister must:  (a) cause to be published on the Department’s website a notice: ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00891  Schedule 1  Amendments" ;
