doc:sch-1-sec-577ba-ss-1 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "577BA(1) Authorised conduct—subsection 51(1) of the Competition and" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) The object of this section is to promote the national interest in structural reform of the telecommunications industry by authorising, for the purposes of subsection 51(1) of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010, certain conduct engaged in by:  (a) Telstra; and  (b) NBN corporations; and  (c) certain other persons. Note: If conduct is authorised for the purposes of subsection 51(1) of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010, the conduct is disregarded in deciding whether a person has contravened Part IV of that Act. Authorised conduct" ;
    cof:pageNumber "24"^^xsd:integer .

concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-safeguards-act-2010-sch-1-sec-577ba-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "577BA(2) Authorised conduct—subsection 51(1) of the Competition and"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-577ba-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) The giving by Telstra of:  (a) an undertaking under section 577A; or  (b) a variation of an undertaking in force under section 577A; or  (c) a draft migration plan in accordance with an undertaking in force under section 577A; or  (d) a variation of a final migration plan; ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00891  Amendments  Schedule 1 Amendments relating to Telstra  Part 1  Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and Consumer Safeguards) Act 2010          21 is authorised for the purposes of subsection 51(1) of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010." ;
    skos:definition "(2) The giving by Telstra of:  (a) an undertaking under section 577A; or  (b) a variation of an undertaking in force under section 577A; or  (c) a draft migration plan in accordance with an undertaking in force under section 577A; or  (d) a variation of a final migration plan; ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00891  Amendments  Schedule 1 Amendments relating to Telstra  Part 1  Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and Consumer Safeguards) Act 2010          21 is authorised for the purposes of subsection 51(1) of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010."@en ;
