doc:sch-1-sec-22-2-ss-7 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "22(7) Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(7) If:  (a) a person directly or indirectly acquires an asset from Telstra; and  (b) the disposal of the asset by Telstra is required for the compliance by Telstra with an undertaking in force under section 577A; and  (c) the person is identified in the undertaking as the person by whom the asset is to be directly or indirectly acquired; the acquisition of the asset is authorised for the purposes of subsection 51(1) of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010." ;
    cof:pageNumber "26"^^xsd:integer .

concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-safeguards-act-2010-sch-1-sec-22-2-ss-8 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "22(8) Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-22-2-ss-8 ;
    values:originalText "(8) If:  (a) Telstra enters into a contract, arrangement or understanding with an NBN corporation; and  (b) Telstra enters into the contract, arrangement or understanding in order to comply with an undertaking in force under section 577A; then:  (c) the entering into of the contract, arrangement or understanding by Telstra; and  (d) the entering into of the contract, arrangement or understanding by the NBN corporation; and ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00891  Schedule 1  Amendments" ;
    skos:definition "(8) If:  (a) Telstra enters into a contract, arrangement or understanding with an NBN corporation; and  (b) Telstra enters into the contract, arrangement or understanding in order to comply with an undertaking in force under section 577A; then:  (c) the entering into of the contract, arrangement or understanding by Telstra; and  (d) the entering into of the contract, arrangement or understanding by the NBN corporation; and ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00891  Schedule 1  Amendments"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "85e6ad69c40a9229b8938ee312c9de5105a1b11ec516e1777b60ec5abce35a53" ;
    values:partOf concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-safeguards-act-2010-sch-1-sec-22-2 ;
    cof:pageNumber "26"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "If Telstra enters into a contract with an NBN corporation to comply with an undertaking in force under section 577A, then both parties must enter into the contract." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-safeguards-act-2010.pdf> ;
    dc:source "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-safeguards-act-2010.pdf, p.26" ;
    cml:asserts concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-safeguards-act-2010-sch-1-sec-22-2-ss-8-norm .
