concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-safeguards-act-2010-sch-1-sec-577bb-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "577BB(2) Migration plan principles"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-577bb-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) Before making or varying a determination under subsection (1), the Minister must:  (a) cause to be published on the Department’s website a notice:  (i) setting out the draft determination or variation; and  (ii) inviting persons to make submissions to the Minister about the draft determination or variation within 14 days after the notice is published; and  (b) consider any submissions received within the 14-day period mentioned in paragraph (a). Publication requirement" ;
    skos:definition "(2) Before making or varying a determination under subsection (1), the Minister must:  (a) cause to be published on the Department’s website a notice:  (i) setting out the draft determination or variation; and  (ii) inviting persons to make submissions to the Minister about the draft determination or variation within 14 days after the notice is published; and  (b) consider any submissions received within the 14-day period mentioned in paragraph (a). Publication requirement"@en ;
