concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-safeguards-act-2010-sch-1-sec-30-2-ss-2 cml:asserts concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-safeguards-act-2010-sch-1-sec-30-2-ss-2-logic-argumentation-3 .
