    skos:definition "(1) This section applies if:  (a) Telstra has given the ACCC an undertaking under section 577A; and  (b) Telstra gives the ACCC a draft migration plan (the original plan) in compliance with a direction under:  (i) subparagraph 577BD(2)(b)(ii); or  (ii) subparagraph (2)(b)(ii) of this section. Decision"@en ;
