doc:sch-1-sec-32-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "32(2) Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) The ACCC must: ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00891  Amendments  Schedule 1 Amendments relating to Telstra  Part 1  Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and Consumer Safeguards) Act 2010          33  (a) if the ACCC is satisfied that the original plan complies with the migration plan principles—approve the original plan; or  (b) otherwise:  (i) refuse to approve the original plan; and  (ii) by written notice given to Telstra, direct Telstra to give the ACCC, within 30 days after the notice is given, a replacement draft migration plan that complies with the migration plan principles. Note: For migration plan principles, see section 577BB. Consultation" ;
