concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-safeguards-act-2010-sch-1-sec-36 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "36 Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-36 ;
    values:originalText "Consumer Safeguards) Act 2010  (4) A final migration plan may not be withdrawn.  (5) When a final migration plan comes into force, the relevant undertaking under section 577A has effect as if the provisions of the plan were provisions of the undertaking. Publication requirement  (6) As soon as practicable after a final migration plan comes into force, the ACCC must publish a copy of the plan on the ACCC’s website. ACCC’s functions and powers  (7) If a final migration plan provides for the ACCC to perform functions or exercise powers in relation to the plan, the ACCC may perform those functions, and exercise those powers, in accordance with the plan. Plan is not a legislative instrument  (8) A final migration plan is not a legislative instrument." ;
    skos:definition "Consumer Safeguards) Act 2010  (4) A final migration plan may not be withdrawn.  (5) When a final migration plan comes into force, the relevant undertaking under section 577A has effect as if the provisions of the plan were provisions of the undertaking. Publication requirement  (6) As soon as practicable after a final migration plan comes into force, the ACCC must publish a copy of the plan on the ACCC’s website. ACCC’s functions and powers  (7) If a final migration plan provides for the ACCC to perform functions or exercise powers in relation to the plan, the ACCC may perform those functions, and exercise those powers, in accordance with the plan. Plan is not a legislative instrument  (8) A final migration plan is not a legislative instrument."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "6dc73eabdd8a6fb43f22537c8088fb7dba9c468f96e0808bf567aa75882e435d" ;
    cof:pageNumber "40"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-safeguards-act-2010-sch-1-sec-36-ss-4 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-safeguards-act-2010-sch-1-sec-36-ss-5 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-safeguards-act-2010-sch-1-sec-36-ss-6 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-safeguards-act-2010-sch-1-sec-36-ss-7 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-safeguards-act-2010-sch-1-sec-36-ss-8 ;
