concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-safeguards-act-2010-sch-1-sec-44 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "44 Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-44 ;
    values:originalText "Consumer Safeguards) Act 2010  (3) The undertaking must be expressed to be an undertaking under this section.  (4) The undertaking may not be withdrawn after it has been accepted by the ACCC.  (5) If the undertaking provides for the ACCC to perform functions or exercise powers in relation to the undertaking, the ACCC may perform those functions, and exercise those powers, in accordance with the undertaking.  (6) For the purposes of this section, the question of whether Telstra is in a position to exercise control of a subscription television broadcasting licence is to be determined under Schedule 1 to the Broadcasting Services Act 1992.  (7) The Minister must cause a copy of an instrument under subsection (1B) to be published on the Department’s website.  (8) An instrument under subsection (1B) is not a legislative instrument." ;
    skos:definition "Consumer Safeguards) Act 2010  (3) The undertaking must be expressed to be an undertaking under this section.  (4) The undertaking may not be withdrawn after it has been accepted by the ACCC.  (5) If the undertaking provides for the ACCC to perform functions or exercise powers in relation to the undertaking, the ACCC may perform those functions, and exercise those powers, in accordance with the undertaking.  (6) For the purposes of this section, the question of whether Telstra is in a position to exercise control of a subscription television broadcasting licence is to be determined under Schedule 1 to the Broadcasting Services Act 1992.  (7) The Minister must cause a copy of an instrument under subsection (1B) to be published on the Department’s website.  (8) An instrument under subsection (1B) is not a legislative instrument."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "6dc73eabdd8a6fb43f22537c8088fb7dba9c468f96e0808bf567aa75882e435d" ;
    cof:pageNumber "48"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-safeguards-act-2010-sch-1-sec-44-ss-3 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-safeguards-act-2010-sch-1-sec-44-ss-4 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-safeguards-act-2010-sch-1-sec-44-ss-5 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-safeguards-act-2010-sch-1-sec-44-ss-6 ;
