    values:originalText "(8) If:  (a) a decision to accept an undertaking under section 577E is expressed to be subject to the occurrence of 2 or more specified events within a specified period; and  (b) one or more of those events do not occur within that period; this Act has effect as if the undertaking had never been accepted by the ACCC. Publication requirement" ;
    skos:definition "(8) If:  (a) a decision to accept an undertaking under section 577E is expressed to be subject to the occurrence of 2 or more specified events within a specified period; and  (b) one or more of those events do not occur within that period; this Act has effect as if the undertaking had never been accepted by the ACCC. Publication requirement"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "ce4e1ff164420d72b4933de0aea4a6d7c48e49a514bdb49d1eb8a726b7f26959" ;
    values:partOf concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-safeguards-act-2010-sch-1-sec-46 ;
    cof:pageNumber "50"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "If events do not occur within the specified period, the undertaking is not accepted." ;
