    cof:title "577ED Compliance with undertaking about subscription television" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "broadcasting licences  If an undertaking given by Telstra is in force under section 577E, Telstra must comply with the undertaking. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00891  Schedule 1  Amendments" ;
