concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-safeguards-act-2010-sch-1-sec-577h a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "577H Designated part of the spectrum"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-577h ;
    values:originalText "(1) For the purposes of this Act, each of the following parts of the spectrum is a designated part of the spectrum:  (a) frequencies higher than 520 MHz, up to and including 820 MHz;  (b) frequencies higher than 2.5 GHz, up to and including 2.69 GHz.  (2) Subsection (1) has effect subject to subsection (3).  (3) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, determine that a specified part of the spectrum is not a designated part of the spectrum for the purposes of this Act.  (4) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, determine that a specified part of the spectrum is a designated part of the spectrum for the purposes of this Act. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00891  Amendments  Schedule 1 Amendments relating to Telstra  Part 1  Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and Consumer Safeguards) Act 2010          51" ;
    skos:definition "(1) For the purposes of this Act, each of the following parts of the spectrum is a designated part of the spectrum:  (a) frequencies higher than 520 MHz, up to and including 820 MHz;  (b) frequencies higher than 2.5 GHz, up to and including 2.69 GHz.  (2) Subsection (1) has effect subject to subsection (3).  (3) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, determine that a specified part of the spectrum is not a designated part of the spectrum for the purposes of this Act.  (4) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, determine that a specified part of the spectrum is a designated part of the spectrum for the purposes of this Act. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00891  Amendments  Schedule 1 Amendments relating to Telstra  Part 1  Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and Consumer Safeguards) Act 2010          51"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "13c6e3fed6287eb70d4babaf2cb46aeb667ac01b01ac2ebd513232b098f9d1b7" ;
    cof:pageNumber "54"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-safeguards-act-2010-sch-1-sec-577h-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-safeguards-act-2010-sch-1-sec-577h-ss-2 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-safeguards-act-2010-sch-1-sec-577h-ss-3 ;
