doc:sch-1-sec-577k-ss-1 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "577K(1) Limits on use of certain spectrum licences by Telstra" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) If:  (a) the excluded spectrum regime applies to Telstra; and  (b) a spectrum licence relates to a designated part of the spectrum; the licensee of the spectrum licence must not authorise Telstra to operate radiocommunications devices under the licence. Note: For excluded spectrum regime, see section 577GA." ;
    cof:pageNumber "57"^^xsd:integer .

concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-safeguards-act-2010-sch-1-sec-577k-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "577K(2) Limits on use of certain spectrum licences by Telstra"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-577k-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) However, the rule in subsection (1) does not apply if:  (a) both:  (i) an undertaking given by Telstra is in force under section 577A; and  (ii) the undertaking is covered by subsection (2A); and  (b) either:  (i) an undertaking given by Telstra is in force under section 577C; or  (ii) a declaration is in force under subsection 577J(3); and ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00891  Schedule 1  Amendments" ;
    skos:definition "(2) However, the rule in subsection (1) does not apply if:  (a) both:  (i) an undertaking given by Telstra is in force under section 577A; and  (ii) the undertaking is covered by subsection (2A); and  (b) either:  (i) an undertaking given by Telstra is in force under section 577C; or  (ii) a declaration is in force under subsection 577J(3); and ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00891  Schedule 1  Amendments"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "bf96a6e4ddde3f8f4cdb87f7d6270418b881ce5459e18b4d113fffe318423554" ;
    values:partOf concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-safeguards-act-2010-sch-1-sec-577k ;
    cof:pageNumber "57"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Exemption from rule for Telstra undertakings" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-safeguards-act-2010.pdf> ;
    dc:source "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-safeguards-act-2010.pdf, p.57" ;
    cml:asserts concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-safeguards-act-2010-sch-1-sec-577k-ss-2-norm .
