doc:sch-1-sec-54-ss-2a a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "54(2A) Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2A) This subsection covers a section 577A undertaking if:  (a) the following conditions are satisfied:  (i) the undertaking requires Telstra to give the ACCC a draft migration plan;  (ii) in accordance with the undertaking, Telstra has given the ACCC a draft migration plan;  (iii) the ACCC has approved the draft migration plan under section 577BD, 577BDA, 577BDB or 577BDC; or  (b) the undertaking does not require Telstra to give the ACCC a draft migration plan." ;
