concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-safeguards-act-2010-sch-1-sec-577l-ss-2a a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "577L(2A) Limits on assignment of certain spectrum licences to Telstra"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-577l-ss-2a ;
    values:originalText "(2A) This subsection covers a section 577A undertaking if:  (a) the following conditions are satisfied:  (i) the undertaking requires Telstra to give the ACCC a draft migration plan;  (ii) in accordance with the undertaking, Telstra has given the ACCC a draft migration plan;  (iii) the ACCC has approved the draft migration plan under section 577BD, 577BDA, 577BDB or 577BDC; or  (b) the undertaking does not require Telstra to give the ACCC a draft migration plan. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00891  Schedule 1  Amendments" ;
    skos:definition "(2A) This subsection covers a section 577A undertaking if:  (a) the following conditions are satisfied:  (i) the undertaking requires Telstra to give the ACCC a draft migration plan;  (ii) in accordance with the undertaking, Telstra has given the ACCC a draft migration plan;  (iii) the ACCC has approved the draft migration plan under section 577BD, 577BDA, 577BDB or 577BDC; or  (b) the undertaking does not require Telstra to give the ACCC a draft migration plan. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00891  Schedule 1  Amendments"@en ;
