concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-safeguards-act-2010-sch-1-sec-73 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "73 Contents of draft or final functional separation undertaking"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-73 ;
    values:originalText "(1) A draft or final functional separation undertaking must:  (a) comply with the functional separation principles; and  (b) contain provisions requiring Telstra to establish and maintain a committee to be known as the Oversight and Equivalence Board; and  (c) contain provisions requiring Telstra to require the Oversight and Equivalence Board:  (i) within a specified period after the end of each quarter during which a final functional separation undertaking is in force, to prepare a report about the extent (if any) to which Telstra complied with the undertaking during that quarter; and ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00891  Schedule 1  Amendments" ;
    skos:definition "(1) A draft or final functional separation undertaking must:  (a) comply with the functional separation principles; and  (b) contain provisions requiring Telstra to establish and maintain a committee to be known as the Oversight and Equivalence Board; and  (c) contain provisions requiring Telstra to require the Oversight and Equivalence Board:  (i) within a specified period after the end of each quarter during which a final functional separation undertaking is in force, to prepare a report about the extent (if any) to which Telstra complied with the undertaking during that quarter; and ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00891  Schedule 1  Amendments"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "216eb34a5b7e2dc9fdad00d9501ecd4e14b2eaa868ceae6e6e69dfdfedce4d67" ;
    cof:pageNumber "65"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Telstra must establish and maintain a committee to comply with the functional separation principles." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-safeguards-act-2010.pdf> ;
    dc:source "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-safeguards-act-2010.pdf, p.65" ;
