concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-safeguards-act-2010-sch-1-sec-77-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "77(4) Approval of draft functional separation undertaking by Minister"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-77-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) Before making a decision under paragraph (2)(b) to approve the original undertaking as varied, the Minister must:  (a) give Telstra a notice:  (i) setting out the original undertaking as proposed to be varied; and  (ii) inviting Telstra to make submissions to the Minister, within 14 days after the notice is given, about the original undertaking as proposed to be varied; and ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00891  Schedule 1  Amendments" ;
    skos:definition "(4) Before making a decision under paragraph (2)(b) to approve the original undertaking as varied, the Minister must:  (a) give Telstra a notice:  (i) setting out the original undertaking as proposed to be varied; and  (ii) inviting Telstra to make submissions to the Minister, within 14 days after the notice is given, about the original undertaking as proposed to be varied; and ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00891  Schedule 1  Amendments"@en ;
