concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-safeguards-act-2010-sch-1-sec-87 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "87 Control"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-87 ;
    values:originalText "In this Part, control includes control as a result of, or by means of, trusts, agreements, arrangements, understandings and practices, whether or not having legal or equitable force and whether or not based on legal or equitable rights. 88  When Telstra is in a position to exercise control of a spectrum licence  (1) For the purposes of this Part, Telstra is in a position to exercise control of a spectrum licence if: ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00891  Schedule 1  Amendments" ;
    skos:definition "In this Part, control includes control as a result of, or by means of, trusts, agreements, arrangements, understandings and practices, whether or not having legal or equitable force and whether or not based on legal or equitable rights. 88  When Telstra is in a position to exercise control of a spectrum licence  (1) For the purposes of this Part, Telstra is in a position to exercise control of a spectrum licence if: ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00891  Schedule 1  Amendments"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "b67266f1cb3412cabaed18d7e80d350724bb5f847788ea70372c37abea44216b" ;
    cof:pageNumber "83"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Control includes control as a result of, or by means of, trusts, agreements, arrangements, understandings and practices." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-safeguards-act-2010.pdf> ;
