concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-safeguards-act-2010-sch-1-sec-40-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "40 Transitional—continuity of special Telstra directions"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-40-2 ;
    values:originalText "The repeal of section 151BUAAA of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010 effected by this Part does not affect the continuity of a special Telstra direction (within the meaning of that section) that was in force immediately before the commencement of this item." ;
