concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-safeguards-act-2010-sch-1-sec-58-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "58 After section 152EP"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-58-2 ;
    values:originalText "Insert: 152EPA  Assistance to independent telecommunications adjudicator  (1) For the purposes of this section, the independent telecommunications adjudicator is a company that:  (a) is limited by guarantee; and  (b) is identified, in a final functional separation undertaking in force under Part 9 of Schedule 1 to the Telecommunications ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00891  Amendments  Schedule 1 Amendments relating to Telstra  Part 1  Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and Consumer Safeguards) Act 2010          87 Act 1997, as the independent telecommunications adjudicator for the purpose of this section.  (2) The Commission may assist the independent telecommunications adjudicator.  (3) The assistance may include the following:  (a) the provision of information (including protected information within the meaning of section 155AAA);  (b) the provision of advice;  (c) the making available of resources and facilities (including secretariat services and clerical assistance)." ;
    skos:definition "Insert: 152EPA  Assistance to independent telecommunications adjudicator  (1) For the purposes of this section, the independent telecommunications adjudicator is a company that:  (a) is limited by guarantee; and  (b) is identified, in a final functional separation undertaking in force under Part 9 of Schedule 1 to the Telecommunications ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00891  Amendments  Schedule 1 Amendments relating to Telstra  Part 1  Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and Consumer Safeguards) Act 2010          87 Act 1997, as the independent telecommunications adjudicator for the purpose of this section.  (2) The Commission may assist the independent telecommunications adjudicator.  (3) The assistance may include the following:  (a) the provision of information (including protected information within the meaning of section 155AAA);  (b) the provision of advice;  (c) the making available of resources and facilities (including secretariat services and clerical assistance)."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "b71e638db90dee0be27247f23bb9b84cd3010f04d98cec8a59e242590d36d242" ;
    cof:pageNumber "90"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-safeguards-act-2010-sch-1-sec-58-2-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-safeguards-act-2010-sch-1-sec-58-2-ss-2 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-safeguards-act-2010-sch-1-sec-58-2-ss-3 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
