    values:originalText "(1) For the purposes of this section, the independent telecommunications adjudicator is a company that:  (a) is limited by guarantee; and  (b) is identified, in a final functional separation undertaking in force under Part 9 of Schedule 1 to the Telecommunications ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00891  Amendments  Schedule 1 Amendments relating to Telstra  Part 1  Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and Consumer Safeguards) Act 2010          87 Act 1997, as the independent telecommunications adjudicator for the purpose of this section." ;
    cof:pageNumber "90"^^xsd:integer .

