concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-safeguards-act-2010-sch-1-sec-152eq-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "152EQ Assistance to independent telecommunications adjudicator"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-152eq-2 ;
    values:originalText "(1) For the purposes of this section, the independent telecommunications adjudicator is a company that:  (a) is limited by guarantee; and  (b) is identified, in an undertaking in force under section 577A of the Telecommunications Act 1997, as the independent telecommunications adjudicator for the purpose of this section.  (2) The Commission may assist the independent telecommunications adjudicator. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00891  Schedule 1  Amendments" ;
