    skos:prefLabel "90 Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-90 ;
    values:originalText "Consumer Safeguards) Act 2010  (3) The assistance may include the following:  (a) the provision of information (including protected information within the meaning of section 155AAA);  (b) the provision of advice;  (c) the making available of resources and facilities (including secretariat services and clerical assistance). ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00891  Amendments  Schedule 1 Telecommunications access regime  Part 2  Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and Consumer Safeguards) Act 2010          91" ;
    skos:definition "Consumer Safeguards) Act 2010  (3) The assistance may include the following:  (a) the provision of information (including protected information within the meaning of section 155AAA);  (b) the provision of advice;  (c) the making available of resources and facilities (including secretariat services and clerical assistance). ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00891  Amendments  Schedule 1 Telecommunications access regime  Part 2  Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and Consumer Safeguards) Act 2010          91"@en ;
