concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-safeguards-act-2010-sch-1-sec-73-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "73 After subsection 69(7)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-73-2 ;
    values:originalText "Insert:  (7A) Subsection (1) does not apply to the condition set out in section 152BCO of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010. Note: Section 152BCO of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010 deals with access determinations.  (7B) Subsection (1) does not apply to the condition set out in section 152BDF of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010. Note: Section 152BDF of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010 deals with binding rules of conduct.  (7C) Subsection (1) does not apply to the condition set out in section 152BEC of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010. Note: Section 152BEC of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010 deals with access agreements. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00891  Amendments  Schedule 1 Telecommunications access regime  Part 2  Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and Consumer Safeguards) Act 2010          93" ;
    skos:definition "Insert:  (7A) Subsection (1) does not apply to the condition set out in section 152BCO of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010. Note: Section 152BCO of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010 deals with access determinations.  (7B) Subsection (1) does not apply to the condition set out in section 152BDF of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010. Note: Section 152BDF of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010 deals with binding rules of conduct.  (7C) Subsection (1) does not apply to the condition set out in section 152BEC of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010. Note: Section 152BEC of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010 deals with access agreements. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00891  Amendments  Schedule 1 Telecommunications access regime  Part 2  Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and Consumer Safeguards) Act 2010          93"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "8445d5cfe714f4491bdd7be3a32948e53e2a96ef2d6d75ca8d501fbc73a359c4" ;
    cof:pageNumber "96"^^xsd:integer ;
