    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) This section applies if:  (a) the ACCC has held a public inquiry (the original inquiry) under this Part; and ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00891  Amendments  Schedule 1 Telecommunications access regime  Part 2  Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and Consumer Safeguards) Act 2010          97  (b) any of the following subparagraphs applies:  (i) evidence or other material was presented to a hearing for the purposes of the original inquiry;  (ii) a written submission was lodged with the ACCC for the purposes of the original inquiry;  (iii) any other information obtained by the ACCC was used by the ACCC for the purposes of the original inquiry; and  (c) the ACCC holds another public inquiry under this Part." ;
    cof:pageNumber "100"^^xsd:integer .

concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-safeguards-act-2010-sch-1-sec-505a-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "505A(2) ACCC may use material presented to a previous public"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-505a-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) The ACCC may:  (a) in the case of evidence or other material presented to a hearing—treat the whole or a part of the evidence or other material as if it had also been presented to a hearing for the purposes of the other public inquiry; or  (b) in the case of a written submission lodged with the ACCC— treat the whole or a part of the written submission as if it had also been lodged with the ACCC for the purposes of the other public inquiry; or  (c) in the case of any other information obtained by the ACCC— use the whole or a part of the information for the purposes of the other public inquiry." ;
    skos:definition "(2) The ACCC may:  (a) in the case of evidence or other material presented to a hearing—treat the whole or a part of the evidence or other material as if it had also been presented to a hearing for the purposes of the other public inquiry; or  (b) in the case of a written submission lodged with the ACCC— treat the whole or a part of the written submission as if it had also been lodged with the ACCC for the purposes of the other public inquiry; or  (c) in the case of any other information obtained by the ACCC— use the whole or a part of the information for the purposes of the other public inquiry."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "12e277344a0a84df5f155586f7046d8bfe2fb12f02b1192852c38bfddbeca231" ;
    values:partOf concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-safeguards-act-2010-sch-1-sec-505a ;
    cof:pageNumber "100"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Treat evidence/material as if presented to another public inquiry" ;
