concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-safeguards-act-2010-sch-1-sec-88-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "88 At the end of subsection 564(3) (after the notes)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-88-2 ;
    values:originalText "Add: Note 5: Section 152BCO of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010 deals with access determinations. Note 6: Subsection 152BCP(2) of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010 provides that a carriage service provider must comply with any access determinations that are applicable to the provider. Note 7: Section 152BDF of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010 deals with binding rules of conduct. Note 8: Subsection 152BDG(2) of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010 provides that a carriage service provider must comply with any binding rules of conduct that are applicable to the provider. Note 9: Section 152BEC of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010 deals with access agreements. Note 10: Subsection 152BED(2) of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010 deals with access agreements." ;
    skos:definition "Add: Note 5: Section 152BCO of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010 deals with access determinations. Note 6: Subsection 152BCP(2) of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010 provides that a carriage service provider must comply with any access determinations that are applicable to the provider. Note 7: Section 152BDF of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010 deals with binding rules of conduct. Note 8: Subsection 152BDG(2) of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010 provides that a carriage service provider must comply with any binding rules of conduct that are applicable to the provider. Note 9: Section 152BEC of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010 deals with access agreements. Note 10: Subsection 152BED(2) of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010 deals with access agreements."@en ;
