concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-safeguards-act-2010-sch-1-sec-96-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "96 At the end of clause 18 of Schedule 1"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-96-2 ;
    values:originalText "Add:  (6) An arbitrator must not make a determination under this clause if the determination would have the effect of:  (a) preventing Telstra from complying with an undertaking in force under section 577A, 577C or 577E; or  (b) if a final migration plan is in force—requiring Telstra to engage in conduct in connection with matters covered by the final migration plan.  (7) If:  (a) an agreement mentioned in paragraph (1)(a) is in force; and  (b) the agreement is in writing; a determination under this clause has no effect to the extent to which it is inconsistent with the agreement." ;
    skos:definition "Add:  (6) An arbitrator must not make a determination under this clause if the determination would have the effect of:  (a) preventing Telstra from complying with an undertaking in force under section 577A, 577C or 577E; or  (b) if a final migration plan is in force—requiring Telstra to engage in conduct in connection with matters covered by the final migration plan.  (7) If:  (a) an agreement mentioned in paragraph (1)(a) is in force; and  (b) the agreement is in writing; a determination under this clause has no effect to the extent to which it is inconsistent with the agreement."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "f552a1e79bdc74d313b3f0f000e309faa363c9b81f8db6b9d0fb2b41f0dcea48" ;
    cof:pageNumber "105"^^xsd:integer ;
