    cml:modality cml:Argumentation ;
    cml:operator "Implication" ;
    cml:logicSummary "The determination implies that Telstra's compliance with undertakings is necessary." ;
    cml:premiseText "(6) An arbitrator must not make a determination under this clause if..." ;
    cml:conclusionText "...would have the effect of: (a) preventing Telstra from complying with an undertaking in force under section 577A, 577C or 577E;" ;
    cml:executionSurface "modalities::argumentation" ;
    cml:confidence "1.0000"^^xsd:decimal ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed .
doc:sch-1-sec-96-2-ss-6 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "96(6) At the end of clause 18 of Schedule 1" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(6) An arbitrator must not make a determination under this clause if the determination would have the effect of:  (a) preventing Telstra from complying with an undertaking in force under section 577A, 577C or 577E; or  (b) if a final migration plan is in force—requiring Telstra to engage in conduct in connection with matters covered by the final migration plan." ;
    cof:pageNumber "105"^^xsd:integer .

concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-safeguards-act-2010-sch-1-sec-96-2-ss-7 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "96(7) At the end of clause 18 of Schedule 1"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-96-2-ss-7 ;
    values:originalText "(7) If:  (a) an agreement mentioned in paragraph (1)(a) is in force; and  (b) the agreement is in writing; a determination under this clause has no effect to the extent to which it is inconsistent with the agreement." ;
