doc:sch-1-sec-102-2-ss-8 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "102(8) At the end of clause 33 of Schedule 1" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(8) For the purposes of subclause (1), if:  (a) there is an agreement in force between Telstra and an NBN corporation; and ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00891  Amendments  Schedule 1 Telecommunications access regime  Part 2  Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and Consumer Safeguards) Act 2010          103  (b) the agreement relates to the NBN corporation’s access to a telecommunications transmission tower owned or operated by Telstra; and  (c) apart from this clause, the agreement would result in the NBN corporation being the operator of the telecommunications transmission tower; the NBN corporation is taken not to be the operator of the telecommunications transmission tower." ;
    cof:pageNumber "106"^^xsd:integer .

