concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-safeguards-act-2010-sch-1-sec-106-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "106 Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-106-2 ;
    values:originalText "Consumer Safeguards) Act 2010 paragraph (6)(a) has effect, in relation to the contract, as if, at the time the request was made:  (d) the contract was in force; and  (e) the person had the right under the contract.  (8) For the purposes of subclause (1), if:  (a) there is an agreement in force between Telstra and an NBN corporation; and  (b) the agreement relates to the NBN corporation’s access to an eligible underground facility owned or operated by Telstra; and  (c) apart from this clause, the agreement would result in the NBN corporation being the operator of the eligible underground facility; the NBN corporation is taken not to be the operator of the eligible underground facility." ;
    skos:definition "Consumer Safeguards) Act 2010 paragraph (6)(a) has effect, in relation to the contract, as if, at the time the request was made:  (d) the contract was in force; and  (e) the person had the right under the contract.  (8) For the purposes of subclause (1), if:  (a) there is an agreement in force between Telstra and an NBN corporation; and  (b) the agreement relates to the NBN corporation’s access to an eligible underground facility owned or operated by Telstra; and  (c) apart from this clause, the agreement would result in the NBN corporation being the operator of the eligible underground facility; the NBN corporation is taken not to be the operator of the eligible underground facility."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "1fdab7445810e9e701f2efd3cc068be8af5d3a6107cac5bb0a51ab403661cfd8" ;
    cof:pageNumber "110"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "The NBN corporation is taken to not be the operator of an eligible underground facility under certain agreements." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-safeguards-act-2010.pdf> ;
