concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-safeguards-act-2010-sch-1-sec-141 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "141 After subsection 152ASA(11)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-141 ;
    values:originalText "Insert: Variation or revocation of determination  (11A) Subsection 33(3) of the Acts Interpretation Act 1901 applies to a power conferred on the Commission by subsection (1), but it applies with the following changes.  (11B) A provision referred to in paragraph (2A)(a) or (b) or (2B)(a) or (b) cannot be varied or removed.  (11C) A determination under this section must not be varied or revoked in a manner that is inconsistent with a provision referred to in paragraph (2A)(a) or (b) or (2B)(a) or (b)." ;
    skos:definition "Insert: Variation or revocation of determination  (11A) Subsection 33(3) of the Acts Interpretation Act 1901 applies to a power conferred on the Commission by subsection (1), but it applies with the following changes.  (11B) A provision referred to in paragraph (2A)(a) or (b) or (2B)(a) or (b) cannot be varied or removed.  (11C) A determination under this section must not be varied or revoked in a manner that is inconsistent with a provision referred to in paragraph (2A)(a) or (b) or (2B)(a) or (b)."@en ;
