doc:sch-1-sec-120-2-ss-5 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "120(5) Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(5) An access determination is of no effect to the extent to which it contravenes subsection (1), (3) or (3A). ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00891  Amendments  Schedule 1 Telecommunications access regime  Part 2  Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and Consumer Safeguards) Act 2010          121" ;
