concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-safeguards-act-2010-sch-1-sec-124-2-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "124(4) Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-124-2-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) If:  (a) an access determination is expressed to replace a previous access determination relating to access to the declared service; and  (b) the previous access determination is not an interim access determination; the specified day must be the first day after the expiry of the previous access determination." ;
    skos:definition "(4) If:  (a) an access determination is expressed to replace a previous access determination relating to access to the declared service; and  (b) the previous access determination is not an interim access determination; the specified day must be the first day after the expiry of the previous access determination."@en ;
