concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-safeguards-act-2010-sch-1-sec-124-2-ss-6 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "124(6) Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-124-2-ss-6 ;
    values:originalText "(6) In specifying an expiry date for an access determination, the Commission must have regard to:  (a) in a case where the declared service is covered by a declaration under section 152AL—the principle that the expiry date for the determination should be the same as the ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00891  Amendments  Schedule 1 Telecommunications access regime  Part 2  Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and Consumer Safeguards) Act 2010          125 expiry date for the declaration (as that declaration stood at the time when the access determination was made) unless, in the Commission’s opinion, there are circumstances that warrant the specification of another date as the expiry date for the access determination; and  (b) such other matters (if any) as the Commission considers relevant." ;
    skos:definition "(6) In specifying an expiry date for an access determination, the Commission must have regard to:  (a) in a case where the declared service is covered by a declaration under section 152AL—the principle that the expiry date for the determination should be the same as the ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00891  Amendments  Schedule 1 Telecommunications access regime  Part 2  Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and Consumer Safeguards) Act 2010          125 expiry date for the declaration (as that declaration stood at the time when the access determination was made) unless, in the Commission’s opinion, there are circumstances that warrant the specification of another date as the expiry date for the access determination; and  (b) such other matters (if any) as the Commission considers relevant."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "319a02c8e9842e2eff69fba08fef3e4f57dc9acc0d4ba6f1b5f3d48833687a46" ;
    values:partOf concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-safeguards-act-2010-sch-1-sec-124-2 ;
    cof:pageNumber "128"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "The Commission must have regard to certain matters when specifying an expiry date for an access determination." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-safeguards-act-2010.pdf> ;
