concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-safeguards-act-2010-sch-1-sec-124-2-ss-7 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "124(7) Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-124-2-ss-7 ;
    values:originalText "(7) If an access determination expires, this Part does not prevent the Commission from making a fresh access determination under section 152BC in the same terms as the expired access determination. Automatic revocation of access determination" ;
    skos:definition "(7) If an access determination expires, this Part does not prevent the Commission from making a fresh access determination under section 152BC in the same terms as the expired access determination. Automatic revocation of access determination"@en ;
