concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-safeguards-act-2010-sch-1-sec-126-2-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "126(3) Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-126-2-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) The day specified in an interim access determination as the day on which the determination is to come into force must not be earlier than the day on which the declaration mentioned in paragraph (1)(a) or (2)(a), as the case may be, came into force. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00891  Schedule 1  Amendments" ;
    skos:definition "(3) The day specified in an interim access determination as the day on which the determination is to come into force must not be earlier than the day on which the declaration mentioned in paragraph (1)(a) or (2)(a), as the case may be, came into force. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00891  Schedule 1  Amendments"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "b855754438ec8db2b9c331516015656f060d1e7886c9214590ed65e8114092bf" ;
    values:partOf concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-safeguards-act-2010-sch-1-sec-126-2 ;
