concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-safeguards-act-2010-sch-1-sec-132-2-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "132(2) Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-132-2-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) The Commission is not required to hold a public inquiry under Part 25 the Telecommunications Act 1997 about a proposal to vary an access determination if:  (a) the variation is of a minor nature; or  (b) each:  (i) carrier or carriage service provider; and  (ii) access seeker;  whose interests are likely to be affected by the variation has consented in writing to the variation. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00891  Amendments  Schedule 1 Telecommunications access regime  Part 2  Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and Consumer Safeguards) Act 2010          133" ;
    skos:definition "(2) The Commission is not required to hold a public inquiry under Part 25 the Telecommunications Act 1997 about a proposal to vary an access determination if:  (a) the variation is of a minor nature; or  (b) each:  (i) carrier or carriage service provider; and  (ii) access seeker;  whose interests are likely to be affected by the variation has consented in writing to the variation. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00891  Amendments  Schedule 1 Telecommunications access regime  Part 2  Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and Consumer Safeguards) Act 2010          133"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "dca83975d4909a954fe38317724f60487f4dd620089205a9a238784d3e5601ec" ;
    values:partOf concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-safeguards-act-2010-sch-1-sec-132-2 ;
    cof:pageNumber "136"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Commission must make final access determination within 6 months after commencement. Commission not required to hold public inquiry under Part 25 if proposal is of minor nature and affected parties consent in writing." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-safeguards-act-2010.pdf> ;
