doc:sch-1-sec-132-2-ss-3 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "132(3) Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) The Commission is not required to hold a public inquiry under Part 25 of the Telecommunications Act 1997 about a proposal to revoke an access determination if the Commission is satisfied that each:  (a) carrier or service provider; and  (b) access seeker; whose interests are likely to be affected by the revocation has consented in writing to the revocation." ;
    cof:pageNumber "136"^^xsd:integer .

concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-safeguards-act-2010-sch-1-sec-132-2-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "132(4) Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-132-2-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) If a fixed principles provision is included in an access determination:  (a) a provision referred to in paragraph 152BCD(5)(a) or (b) cannot be varied or removed; and  (b) the access determination must not be varied in a manner that is inconsistent with a provision referred to in paragraph 152BCD(5)(a) or (b)." ;
    skos:definition "(4) If a fixed principles provision is included in an access determination:  (a) a provision referred to in paragraph 152BCD(5)(a) or (b) cannot be varied or removed; and  (b) the access determination must not be varied in a manner that is inconsistent with a provision referred to in paragraph 152BCD(5)(a) or (b)."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "e9c99f5fd43b575491295b339048e0a6a2aeb2d39547c0edfd66b88b2d35525e" ;
    values:partOf concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-safeguards-act-2010-sch-1-sec-132-2 ;
    cof:pageNumber "136"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Prohibition on varying certain provisions in access determinations." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
