    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-163 ;
    values:originalText "Insert:  (3B) The undertaking may also state, in the event that the person supplies the service (whether to itself or to other persons), the person: ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00891  Amendments  Schedule 1 Telecommunications access regime  Part 2  Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and Consumer Safeguards) Act 2010          151  (a) will engage in specified conduct in relation to access to the service; and  (b) will do so on such terms and conditions as are specified in the undertaking." ;
    skos:definition "Insert:  (3B) The undertaking may also state, in the event that the person supplies the service (whether to itself or to other persons), the person: ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00891  Amendments  Schedule 1 Telecommunications access regime  Part 2  Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and Consumer Safeguards) Act 2010          151  (a) will engage in specified conduct in relation to access to the service; and  (b) will do so on such terms and conditions as are specified in the undertaking."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "ccb2198b03325ac6a5917a9197f5d2b9ce5445531d645bf28b080e1c6b0d045e" ;
    cof:pageNumber "154"^^xsd:integer ;
