doc:sch-1-sec-163 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "163 Before subsection 152CBA(4)" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "Insert:  (3B) The undertaking may also state, in the event that the person supplies the service (whether to itself or to other persons), the person: ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00891  Amendments  Schedule 1 Telecommunications access regime  Part 2  Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and Consumer Safeguards) Act 2010          151  (a) will engage in specified conduct in relation to access to the service; and  (b) will do so on such terms and conditions as are specified in the undertaking." ;
