    values:originalText "Repeal the subsection, substitute:  (10) If the undertaking expires, this Part does not prevent the person from giving a fresh special access undertaking in the same terms as the expired undertaking." ;
    skos:definition "Repeal the subsection, substitute:  (10) If the undertaking expires, this Part does not prevent the person from giving a fresh special access undertaking in the same terms as the expired undertaking."@en ;
