doc:sch-1-sec-154-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "154 Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "Consumer Safeguards) Act 2010 Consequences—variation of undertaking  (6) If:  (a) a special access undertaking given by a person in relation to a particular service contains a fixed principles term or condition (the original fixed principles term or condition); and  (b) the undertaking has been accepted by the Commission; and  (c) during the notional fixed period for the original fixed principles term or condition, the person gives the Commission a variation of the undertaking; and  (d) the varied undertaking contains a fixed principles term or condition (the corresponding fixed principles term or condition) that is identical to the original fixed principles term or condition; and  (e) the notional fixed period for the corresponding fixed principles term or condition is identical to the notional fixed period for the original fixed principles term or condition; and  (f) if there are qualifying circumstances in relation to the original fixed principles term or condition:  (i) there are qualifying circumstances in relation to the corresponding fixed principles term or condition; and  (ii) those qualifying circumstances are identical to the qualifying circumstances in relation to the original fixed principles term or condition; and  (g) if there are qualifying circumstances in relation to the original fixed principles term or condition—none of those circumstances exist; the Commission must not reject the variation for a reason that concerns:  (h) the corresponding fixed principles term or condition; or  (i) the notional fixed period for the corresponding fixed principles term or condition; or  (j) if there are qualifying circumstances in relation to the corresponding fixed principles term or condition—the specification of those circumstances." ;
    cof:pageNumber "158"^^xsd:integer .

concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-safeguards-act-2010-sch-1-sec-167 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "167 Before paragraph 152CBC(6)(a)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-167 ;
    values:originalText "Insert: ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00891  Amendments  Schedule 1 Telecommunications access regime  Part 2  Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and Consumer Safeguards) Act 2010          155  (aa) if:  (i) the Commission has given a notice under section 152CBDA in relation to the undertaking; and  (ii) no varied undertaking was given to the Commission in response to the notice;  a day in the period specified in the notice; and  (ab) if:  (i) the Commission has given a notice under section 152CBDA in relation to the undertaking; and  (ii) a varied undertaking was given to the Commission in response to the notice; and  (iii) the Commission did not publish the varied undertaking under paragraph 152CBD(2)(d);  a day in the period:  (iv) beginning on the day in which the notice was given; and  (v) ending when the varied undertaking was given to the Commission in response to the notice; and  (ac) if:  (i) the Commission has given a notice under section 152CBDA in relation to the undertaking; and  (ii) a varied undertaking was given to the Commission in response to the notice; and  (iii) the varied undertaking was published under paragraph 152CBD(2)(d);  a day in the period:  (iv) beginning on the day on which the notice was given; and  (v) ending at the end of the time specified by the Commission when it published the varied undertaking; and" ;
    skos:definition "Insert: ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00891  Amendments  Schedule 1 Telecommunications access regime  Part 2  Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and Consumer Safeguards) Act 2010          155  (aa) if:  (i) the Commission has given a notice under section 152CBDA in relation to the undertaking; and  (ii) no varied undertaking was given to the Commission in response to the notice;  a day in the period specified in the notice; and  (ab) if:  (i) the Commission has given a notice under section 152CBDA in relation to the undertaking; and  (ii) a varied undertaking was given to the Commission in response to the notice; and  (iii) the Commission did not publish the varied undertaking under paragraph 152CBD(2)(d);  a day in the period:  (iv) beginning on the day in which the notice was given; and  (v) ending when the varied undertaking was given to the Commission in response to the notice; and  (ac) if:  (i) the Commission has given a notice under section 152CBDA in relation to the undertaking; and  (ii) a varied undertaking was given to the Commission in response to the notice; and  (iii) the varied undertaking was published under paragraph 152CBD(2)(d);  a day in the period:  (iv) beginning on the day on which the notice was given; and  (v) ending at the end of the time specified by the Commission when it published the varied undertaking; and"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "799423fa6207ca1f8872c6bc695a7e1c9b0f138db932977ddc7e4d9c58733915" ;
    cof:pageNumber "158"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Compliance with notice under section 152CBDA is required." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-safeguards-act-2010.pdf> ;
