concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-safeguards-act-2010-sch-1-sec-174 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "174 After section 152CBI"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-174 ;
    values:originalText "Insert: 152CBIA  Special access undertakings prevail over inconsistent access determinations  An access determination has no effect to the extent to which it is inconsistent with a special access undertaking that is in operation. 152CBIB  Special access undertakings prevail over inconsistent binding rules of conduct  Binding rules of conduct have no effect to the extent to which they are inconsistent with a special access undertaking that is in operation. 152CBIC  Access agreements prevail over special access undertakings  A special access undertaking has no effect to the extent to which it is inconsistent with an access agreement. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00891  Amendments  Schedule 1 Telecommunications access regime  Part 2  Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and Consumer Safeguards) Act 2010          159" ;
    skos:definition "Insert: 152CBIA  Special access undertakings prevail over inconsistent access determinations  An access determination has no effect to the extent to which it is inconsistent with a special access undertaking that is in operation. 152CBIB  Special access undertakings prevail over inconsistent binding rules of conduct  Binding rules of conduct have no effect to the extent to which they are inconsistent with a special access undertaking that is in operation. 152CBIC  Access agreements prevail over special access undertakings  A special access undertaking has no effect to the extent to which it is inconsistent with an access agreement. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00891  Amendments  Schedule 1 Telecommunications access regime  Part 2  Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and Consumer Safeguards) Act 2010          159"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "1db72aca3003df21fd68b736080583b2a247d1032f4af388a83d637d6e8fa7c2" ;
    cof:pageNumber "162"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Special access undertakings prevail over inconsistent access determinations and binding rules of conduct." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-safeguards-act-2010.pdf> ;
