    cof:pageNumber "166"^^xsd:integer .

concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-safeguards-act-2010-sch-1-sec-198 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "198 Definitions"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-198 ;
    values:originalText "In this Division: access agreement has the same meaning as in Part XIC of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010 as amended by this Part. access determination has the same meaning as in Part XIC of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010 as amended by this Part. binding rules of conduct has the same meaning as in Part XIC of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010 as amended by this Part. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00891  Amendments  Schedule 1 Telecommunications access regime  Part 2  Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and Consumer Safeguards) Act 2010          163" ;
    skos:definition "In this Division: access agreement has the same meaning as in Part XIC of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010 as amended by this Part. access determination has the same meaning as in Part XIC of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010 as amended by this Part. binding rules of conduct has the same meaning as in Part XIC of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010 as amended by this Part. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00891  Amendments  Schedule 1 Telecommunications access regime  Part 2  Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and Consumer Safeguards) Act 2010          163"@en ;
