concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-safeguards-act-2010-sch-1-sec-212 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "212 Subsections 151AKA(9) and (10)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-212 ;
    values:originalText "Repeal the subsections (including the note), substitute: Procedural fairness  (9) The Commission is not required to observe any requirements of procedural fairness in relation to the issue of a Part A competition notice. Note: For the effect of a Part A competition notice, see subsections 151BY(3), 151CB(3), 151CC(3) and 151CE(5)." ;
    skos:definition "Repeal the subsections (including the note), substitute: Procedural fairness  (9) The Commission is not required to observe any requirements of procedural fairness in relation to the issue of a Part A competition notice. Note: For the effect of a Part A competition notice, see subsections 151BY(3), 151CB(3), 151CC(3) and 151CE(5)."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "76d7ba1bb00f948778c7745d78809a3412c6df231b0980b242bf030470b554cd" ;
    cof:pageNumber "177"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Commission is not required to observe procedural fairness in relation to Part A competition notices." ;
