concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-safeguards-act-2010-sch-1-sec-176-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "176 Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-176-2 ;
    values:originalText "Consumer Safeguards) Act 2010 basis that the other standard telephone service would be supplied in fulfilment of the universal service obligation; and  (d) the customer has, by written notice given to the provider, acknowledged that the relevant service is not supplied in fulfilment of the universal service obligation; and  (e) the notice complied with such requirements (if any) as are specified in a determination under subsection (4).  (4) The ACMA may, by legislative instrument, determine requirements for the purposes of paragraph (3)(e)." ;
    skos:definition "Consumer Safeguards) Act 2010 basis that the other standard telephone service would be supplied in fulfilment of the universal service obligation; and  (d) the customer has, by written notice given to the provider, acknowledged that the relevant service is not supplied in fulfilment of the universal service obligation; and  (e) the notice complied with such requirements (if any) as are specified in a determination under subsection (4).  (4) The ACMA may, by legislative instrument, determine requirements for the purposes of paragraph (3)(e)."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "14bb038ef85f056de64f486e50320245eadc2bb61a56317b77da3822bf860e2d" ;
