concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-safeguards-act-2010-sch-1-sec-8ba a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "8BA Special meaning of standard telephone service"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-8ba ;
    values:originalText "(1) A reference in this Part to a standard telephone service is a reference to a standard telephone service (within the meaning of section 6) that has the characteristics (if any) specified in a determination under subsection (2).  (2) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, determine specified characteristics for the purposes of subsection (1)." ;
    skos:definition "(1) A reference in this Part to a standard telephone service is a reference to a standard telephone service (within the meaning of section 6) that has the characteristics (if any) specified in a determination under subsection (2).  (2) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, determine specified characteristics for the purposes of subsection (1)."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "91588833f26f3b1364cda5f32cb3c0b78dd966198f6dc826a318d9dd08280d27" ;
