concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-safeguards-act-2010-sch-1-sec-12eb-ss-6 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "12EB(6) Performance standards"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-12eb-ss-6 ;
    values:originalText "(6) This section does not apply to a standard telephone service unless the service is supplied, or proposed to be supplied, in fulfilment of the universal service obligation. Note: See also section 6A (when a standard telephone service is supplied in fulfilment of the universal service obligation). Determination is a legislative instrument" ;
