concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-safeguards-act-2010-sch-1-sec-12ed a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "12ED Performance standards"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-12ed ;
    values:originalText "Determination  (1) The Minister may make a written determination setting out standards to be complied with by a primary universal service provider in relation to any or all of the following matters:  (a) the characteristics of a payphone carriage service;  (b) the supply, installation or maintenance of a payphone;  (c) the supply of a payphone carriage service;  (d) the reliability of a payphone;  (e) the reliability of a payphone carriage service;  (f) the maximum period within which a primary universal service provider must rectify a fault or service difficulty relating to a payphone following the making of a report about a fault or service difficulty;  (g) the maximum period within which a primary universal service provider must rectify a fault or service difficulty relating to a payphone carriage service following the making of a report about a fault or service difficulty;  (h) the handling of requests for the removal of a payphone; ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00891  Schedule 1  Amendments" ;
    skos:definition "Determination  (1) The Minister may make a written determination setting out standards to be complied with by a primary universal service provider in relation to any or all of the following matters:  (a) the characteristics of a payphone carriage service;  (b) the supply, installation or maintenance of a payphone;  (c) the supply of a payphone carriage service;  (d) the reliability of a payphone;  (e) the reliability of a payphone carriage service;  (f) the maximum period within which a primary universal service provider must rectify a fault or service difficulty relating to a payphone following the making of a report about a fault or service difficulty;  (g) the maximum period within which a primary universal service provider must rectify a fault or service difficulty relating to a payphone carriage service following the making of a report about a fault or service difficulty;  (h) the handling of requests for the removal of a payphone; ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00891  Schedule 1  Amendments"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "51aa7c524ae45743030acbbfa36708a7c2a70bdce5dd3b65fe5b9af1877af07d" ;
    cof:pageNumber "185"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Minister may make written determination setting standards for payphone carriage service providers." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-safeguards-act-2010.pdf> ;
    dc:source "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-safeguards-act-2010.pdf, p.185" ;
    cml:asserts concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-safeguards-act-2010-sch-1-sec-12ed-norm .
