concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-safeguards-act-2010-sch-1-sec-12ef-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "12EF(3) Rules about the location of payphones"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-12ef-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) If a primary universal service provider complies with a determination under subsection (1), the provider is taken to have complied with an obligation under paragraph 9(1)(b) or subsection 9(2A), to the extent to which the obligation relates to the location of payphones. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00891  Amendments  Schedule 1 Universal service regime  Part 4  Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and Consumer Safeguards) Act 2010          185 Determination prevails over inconsistent instruments" ;
    skos:definition "(3) If a primary universal service provider complies with a determination under subsection (1), the provider is taken to have complied with an obligation under paragraph 9(1)(b) or subsection 9(2A), to the extent to which the obligation relates to the location of payphones. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00891  Amendments  Schedule 1 Universal service regime  Part 4  Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and Consumer Safeguards) Act 2010          185 Determination prevails over inconsistent instruments"@en ;
