concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-safeguards-act-2010-sch-1-sec-12ef-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "12EF(4) Rules about the location of payphones"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-12ef-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) Each of the following instruments:  (a) an approved policy statement for a primary universal service provider;  (b) an approved standard marketing plan for a primary universal service provider; has no effect to the extent to which the instrument is inconsistent with a determination in force under subsection (1). Determination is a legislative instrument" ;
    skos:definition "(4) Each of the following instruments:  (a) an approved policy statement for a primary universal service provider;  (b) an approved standard marketing plan for a primary universal service provider; has no effect to the extent to which the instrument is inconsistent with a determination in force under subsection (1). Determination is a legislative instrument"@en ;
