    values:originalText "(2) The Minister must ensure that a determination under subsection (1) provides that, if:  (a) a primary universal service provider makes a decision to remove a payphone from a particular location; and  (b) that payphone is the only payphone at that location; then:  (c) the provider must undertake a process for public consultation on the removal of that payphone; and  (d) if, in accordance with that process, a person makes a submission to the provider—the provider must notify the person, in writing, of the outcome of that process. Compliance" ;
    cof:pageNumber "189"^^xsd:integer .

