doc:sch-1-sec-186-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "186 Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "Consumer Safeguards) Act 2010  (a) an approved policy statement for a primary universal service provider;  (b) an approved standard marketing plan for a primary universal service provider; has no effect to the extent to which the instrument is inconsistent with a determination in force under subsection (1). Determination is a legislative instrument  (5) A determination under subsection (1) is a legislative instrument." ;
