    cof:title "12EH(3) Rules about the process for resolution of complaints about the" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) Each of the following instruments:  (a) an approved policy statement for a primary universal service provider;  (b) an approved standard marketing plan for a primary universal service provider; has no effect to the extent to which the instrument is inconsistent with a determination in force under subsection (1). Determination is a legislative instrument" ;
    cof:pageNumber "190"^^xsd:integer .

