    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "For the purposes of this Part, if:  (a) a carriage service provider (the first provider) supplies, or proposes to supply, a carriage service to another carriage service provider (the second provider); and ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00891  Schedule 1  Amendments" ;
    cof:pageNumber "193"^^xsd:integer .

concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-safeguards-act-2010-sch-1-sec-190-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "190 Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-190-2 ;
    values:originalText "Consumer Safeguards) Act 2010  (b) the carriage service is, or is to be, supplied to the second provider in order that the second provider can provide a carriage service; then:  (c) the carriage service that is, or is to be, supplied to the second provider is a wholesale carriage service; and  (d) the second provider is a wholesale customer of the first provider." ;
    skos:definition "Consumer Safeguards) Act 2010  (b) the carriage service is, or is to be, supplied to the second provider in order that the second provider can provide a carriage service; then:  (c) the carriage service that is, or is to be, supplied to the second provider is a wholesale carriage service; and  (d) the second provider is a wholesale customer of the first provider."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "9878a84e8b274d9aad61674e4a8defd70536b1260d53557459d1039c2a3658e0" ;
    cof:pageNumber "194"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Second provider must be a wholesale customer of the first provider." ;
