concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-safeguards-act-2010-sch-1-sec-117f a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "117F Compliance with performance benchmarks"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-117f ;
    values:originalText "Scope  (1) This section applies if an instrument under section 117E is applicable to a carriage service provider (the first provider). Provider must meet or exceed minimum benchmark  (2) The first provider must meet or exceed a minimum benchmark set by the instrument. Contravention caused by another provider  (3) For the purposes of determining whether the first provider has met or exceeded a minimum benchmark set by the instrument, if:  (a) the first provider has contravened a standard in force under section 117D; and  (b) the contravention is wholly or partly attributable to one or more acts or omissions of another carriage service provider; the first provider is taken not to have contravened the standard." ;
    skos:definition "Scope  (1) This section applies if an instrument under section 117E is applicable to a carriage service provider (the first provider). Provider must meet or exceed minimum benchmark  (2) The first provider must meet or exceed a minimum benchmark set by the instrument. Contravention caused by another provider  (3) For the purposes of determining whether the first provider has met or exceeded a minimum benchmark set by the instrument, if:  (a) the first provider has contravened a standard in force under section 117D; and  (b) the contravention is wholly or partly attributable to one or more acts or omissions of another carriage service provider; the first provider is taken not to have contravened the standard."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "b073f6c68ef8721107fd9815b19b2c35ec111d526b75c2123d1111ba64424000" ;
    cof:pageNumber "196"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-safeguards-act-2010-sch-1-sec-117f-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-safeguards-act-2010-sch-1-sec-117f-ss-2 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-safeguards-act-2010-sch-1-sec-117f-ss-3 ;
