concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-safeguards-act-2010-sch-1-sec-120a a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "120A Carriage service may be supplied on condition that the"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-120a ;
    values:originalText "customer waives the customer service guarantee  This Act does not prevent, and is taken never to have prevented, a carriage service provider from supplying, or proposing to supply, a particular carriage service to a customer on condition that the customer waives, in accordance with section 120, the customer’s protection and rights under this Part in relation to the carriage service." ;
    skos:definition "customer waives the customer service guarantee  This Act does not prevent, and is taken never to have prevented, a carriage service provider from supplying, or proposing to supply, a particular carriage service to a customer on condition that the customer waives, in accordance with section 120, the customer’s protection and rights under this Part in relation to the carriage service."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "b6705e6a06b145f6f026ba7e490c221cd6a2d89facea2c5f1120fb6d99b14937" ;
    cof:pageNumber "197"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Customer waives protection and rights under this Part in relation to the carriage service." ;
