concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-safeguards-act-2010-sch-1-sec-241-ss-2e a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "241(2E) After subsection 529(2)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-241-ss-2e ;
    values:originalText "(2E) The rules may require or permit a report prepared in accordance with the rules to be given to the ACMA, in accordance with specified software requirements and specified authentication requirements:  (a) on a specified kind of data processing device; or  (b) by way of a specified kind of electronic transmission." ;
    skos:definition "(2E) The rules may require or permit a report prepared in accordance with the rules to be given to the ACMA, in accordance with specified software requirements and specified authentication requirements:  (a) on a specified kind of data processing device; or  (b) by way of a specified kind of electronic transmission."@en ;
