concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-safeguards-act-2010-sch-1-sec-16-7 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "16 Simplified outline"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-16-7 ;
    values:originalText "The following is a simplified outline of this Part: • This Part deals with priority assistance for people with life-threatening medical conditions. • A carriage service provider must comply with the priority assistance industry code. • If a carriage service provider receives an inquiry from a prospective residential customer about the supply of a standard telephone service, and the provider does not offer priority assistance, the provider must:  (a) inform the prospective residential customer that the provider does not offer priority assistance in connection with the service; and  (b) inform the prospective residential customer of the names of one or more carriage service providers from whom the prospective residential customer can obtain priority assistance. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00891  Schedule 1  Amendments" ;
    skos:definition "The following is a simplified outline of this Part: • This Part deals with priority assistance for people with life-threatening medical conditions. • A carriage service provider must comply with the priority assistance industry code. • If a carriage service provider receives an inquiry from a prospective residential customer about the supply of a standard telephone service, and the provider does not offer priority assistance, the provider must:  (a) inform the prospective residential customer that the provider does not offer priority assistance in connection with the service; and  (b) inform the prospective residential customer of the names of one or more carriage service providers from whom the prospective residential customer can obtain priority assistance. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00891  Schedule 1  Amendments"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "41c24708b97e3aefa9bc3787c3ee315012d0b610f1b6bb3c785bd41743c6f4ad" ;
    cof:pageNumber "201"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Must inform prospective customer of non-priority assistance and alternative providers." ;
    dc:description "Information about priority assistance" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
