concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-safeguards-act-2010-sch-1-sec-20-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "20 Requirements for Telstra"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-20-3 ;
    values:originalText "This Part does not impose a requirement on Telstra if clause 19 of the Carrier Licence Conditions (Telstra Corporation Limited) Declaration 1997 is in force. Note: Clause 19 of the Carrier Licence Conditions (Telstra Corporation Limited) Declaration 1997 is about Telstra’s priority assistance obligations. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00891  Schedule 1  Amendments" ;
