concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-safeguards-act-2010-sch-1-sec-208-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "208 Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-208-2 ;
    values:originalText "Consumer Safeguards) Act 2010  (3) An authorised infringement notice officer must not give an infringement notice to a person unless guidelines are in force under subsection (2)." ;
